```rust
// Applied rules: [III④]
// Skipped rules: [C3: no loop-invariant memory location is read repeatedly across potentially aliasing writes; II_vec: loop carries a hash accumulator reduction and sentinel-terminated iteration, so canonicalization would not make it meaningfully vectorizable]
